Hi Caroline,

Sorry for the delay. The syntax you've used is unfortunately not valid in mirt in that mixedmirt() does not support regression models onto other factors in the more SEM flavour (not that it couldn't, I just haven't added this feature yet). It's on the long TODO list though, so perhaps sometime in a future release this feature will appear. HTH.

Phil

