Hi Amalia,

> Error: cannot allocate vector of size 802.5 Mb

That's not very big for a matrix.... do you happen to have a computer that has lower RAM? R is generally memory hungry, so it's good these days to use at least 8GB but preferably even higher, like 16GB+. I've seen this issue come up in other functions too (e.g., M2()), but this to allocate is usually much larger; like something around 10GB+. HTH.

Phil

